---
import ContentLayout from '../../layouts/ContentLayout.astro'; import FeatureCard from '../../components/FeatureCard.astro'; import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
const items=[['Battery & Power','Power faults, battery contacts, and safe first checks.'],['Buttons & Contacts','Input diagnostics and contact cleaning.'],['LCD / Display','Display symptoms and careful inspection.'],['Shell & Cosmetic Repair','Conservation-minded exterior restoration.'],['Corrosion / Water Damage','Assessment and stabilization workflows.'],['Speaker / Audio','Audio-path diagnostics and repair notes.']];
const guides = await getCollection('guides');
---
<ContentLayout title="Clinic" description="Repair guides, diagnostics, teardown notes, and common hardware failures." eyebrow="Repair intake // documentation building"><section class="section-block"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Patient intake</p><h2>Guide categories</h2></div><p>Reviewed procedures are still being prepared; these labels show what the clinic will cover.</p></div><div class="card-grid">{items.map(([title,description],i)=><FeatureCard {title} {description} code={`C0${i+1}`} action="Documentation pending" />)}</div></section>{guides.length ? <section class="section-block"><h2>Published guides</h2><ul class="record-list">{guides.map(guide=><li><a href={`/clinic/${guide.id.replace(/\.(md|mdx)$/,'')}/`}>{guide.data.title}</a></li>)}</ul></section> : <section class="section-block empty-state"><p class="technical-label">Guide index // Empty</p><h2>No repair guides published yet.</h2><p>Guides will appear after procedures are documented, safety-reviewed, and ready to reproduce.</p></section>}</ContentLayout><style>.record-list{display:grid;gap:var(--space-3);padding:0;list-style:none}.record-list a{display:block;padding:var(--space-4);border:1px solid var(--tm-border-soft)}</style>
